	(text "eMMC: U11 KIOXIA THGAMVG7T13BAIL, 16 GB eMMC 5.1 (C7599693)\nVCCQ is 1.8 V only and must be the same 1V8 as the HPS: no level translator.\nCMD/DAT pull-ups 10k to 1V8 (KIOXIA: CMD 4.7-100k, DAT 10-100k). DS to HPS_IOA_16 (SDMMC_DATA_STROBE) for HS400, 10k pull-down R242.\nRST_n is ignored until EXT_CSD[162] RST_n_FUNCTION is set; driven by HPS GPIO0_IO12 (emmc_rst_n).\nDecoupling under U11 (bottom side): VCC 4u7 0402 + 220n 0201 (C244, C245), VCCQ 4u7 0402 + 100n 0201 (C242, C243), VDDi 2u2 0201 (C246)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
